        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Civil Rights Data Collection (CRDC)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "CRDC provides collection-cycle data on civil-rights conditions in U.S. public schools and districts. It supplies equity and implementation context; it does not establish that an initiative caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://ocrdata.ed.gov/",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "6f090dc7fef54b9c8bf7253887ff6e22"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "CRDC catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** U.S. Department of Education Office for Civil Rights.\n- **Access:** Public downloadable collection files.\n- **Unit:** Public school and district, collection-year and subgroup-disaggregated.\n- **Coverage:** Collection-cycle dependent; record the collection year and file definition.\n- **Join keys:** LEA ID, school ID, school year, and subgroup.\n- **Measures:** Discipline, restraint and seclusion, advanced-course access, staffing, preschool, and harassment/bullying.\n- **Use boundary:** Preserve changing collection definitions and suppressed values with every analytic use.\n\nCRDC can provide equity, school-climate, opportunity-to-learn, and implementation-risk context. Its released values do not alone establish that a program caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
